  "description": "More power in reserve for heavier loads and steeper terrain.\nWith 85 Nm of torque, it has plenty in hand for steep hills, heavy loads and strong headwinds, yet remains smooth and easy to control in everyday riding.\nThe eBullitt frame's relatively low weight means all that power doesn't go to waste. The result is a cargo bike that feels quick off the line, confident when loaded, and efficient over longer distances.\nAvailable with both internal and external gearing options, this is the choice for riders who regularly ask a bit more from their bike and expect it to keep up. More muscle when you need it, without losing the ride characteristics that make a Bullitt feel like a Bullitt.",
